l,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336307898/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336405379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110908#issuecomment-3336405379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110908","id":3336405379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G3YGD","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T00:48:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T00:52:16Z","body":"I can reproduce the behavior difference, but it does seem reasonable to me that if you're asking for snake case you receive snake case. I went ahead and looked into this and it appears this was an intentional change made in #108642 to fix #108575, which is someone requesting that the node matches what the user asked for.\n\nI'll note that the field you're entering `new_file` into is a `Node` name, not a file name, and so should be pascal cased according to the linked guidelines. Indeed, if you enter `NewFile`, you'll see that everything works as expected: the file is still snake cased automatically and the node name is pascal cased as you want it to be.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336405379/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]